  "bio": "Cinita Medeiros, renowned for her expertise in watercolor, illustrative, and minimalist tattoos, operates out of the bustling heart of Anápolis, Brazil. With a reputation for impeccable cleanliness, clients can rest assured that every session at Fractal Tattoo Studio is conducted with the utmost standards of hygiene and care, reflecting the professionalism that Cinita and her studio are known for. Whether it's through the bold splash of watercolor or the subtle touch of a minimalist design, Cinita's commitment to a clean and safe tattooing environment ensures an experience as flawless as the art she creates.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Anápolis, Goias, Brazil"
